    321  f0ec							; Entered from bank0 via the $FEF0 entry tramp (sta $1FF8 lands on the
    322  f0ec							; jmp below at $FEF3). Exits via `jmp MothExitPad` ($FC49): bank2 runs
    323  f0ec							; sta $1FF6, bank0 serves jmp UE_Next. Rules:
    324  f0ec							;   - NEVER jsr FoldIndirect or any bank0 routine (a fold from inside
    325  f0ec							;     bank2 would switch away mid-routine = frozen player).
    326  f0ec							;   - Enemy records ARE here (org $F9D9) — read directly, no fold needed.
