    698  f2e9							; result depends only on the (col,row) box. Moth rows are band-constant
    699  f2e9							; (Y sine +-6 inside spawn band, MothYDerive) and RAW candidate-col ==
    700  f2e9							; committed-col implies equal vl-cols (vl = f(Temp) deterministic; a raw
    701  f2e9							; mismatch at coarse edges only OVER-walks, never under-walks). Same-col
    702  f2e9							; candidate = the side the moth already arrived from = clear -> commit.
    703  f2e9							; Saves the prologue (~140c) + 5-rect loop (~340c) on every moth-run frame
