   1831  fd39							; --- Phase 3: phase-cell blink (PF buffer pokes) ----------------------
   1832  fd39							; Body moved after the level data (PhaseBlink, ~130B — the StageBandTab
   1833  fd39							; window $F3C4..$F4C4 was full; the data window has the only free
   1834  fd39							; hole). Contract: clobbers A/X/Y/FetchPtr/RectCount/LineCount/
   1835  fd39							; CollisionCellX/CollisionEndY ($8F scratch — the pack below rebuilds
   1836  fd39							; it). The PF buffers ARE the collision map (cell walk + laser read
   1837  fd39							; them) — toggling the cell's two bits THERE makes render + PHM +
   1838  fd39							; laser follow with zero kernel cost. 64f full cycle = EnemyRamP bit5
   1839  fd39							; (32 on + 32 off; clock-derived, no state bytes — locked plan).
